"12 hours (backend default: 43200 seconds). Disabled: manually set "
"PeriodicInformEnable to true and PeriodicInformInterval to at most 180 "
"seconds; no interval is written automatically. Requires reachable CWMP, "
"verified standard parameters, HTTP Digest support, a prior Inform with a "
"ConnectionRequestURL and valid CPE credentials. Firmware support is not "
"guaranteed. Acceptance is not proof of a session or completed RPCs."
msgstr ""
"各设备独立配置，所有适配器默认启用。启用时：按需发起会话，需启用周期性 Inform，间隔不超过 12 小时（后端默认：43200 "
"秒）。禁用时：请手动将 PeriodicInformEnable 设为 true，将 PeriodicInformInterval 设为不超过 180 "
"秒；系统不会自动写入间隔。需要 CWMP 可达、标准参数已校验、支持 HTTP Digest、此前已收到包含 ConnectionRequestURL "
"的 Inform，以及有效的 CPE 凭据。不保证固件支持。请求被接受不代表已建立会话或完成 RPC。"

